# Engineering practices

- One responsibility per function/component; prefer ≤ ~20 lines / ≤ 2 indents
- Named exports only — no default exports for app code; no `React.FC`
- Prefer derived values over storing props/computed data in state
- `useEffect`: extract a **named inner function**; keep deps complete
- Separated `try`/`catch`; avoid returning `null`/`undefined` when a clearer type exists
- Pure helpers in `src/utils`; comment **why**, not what

Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/ENGINEERING.md`
